## What we still need from you

While a request or booking is not complete, **What we still need from you** is the first thing on **Trips** and on the booking: one line for each thing, with its state and one button.

| State | What it means |
| --- | --- |
| Needed | Send it: press the button on the line |
| Not accepted | We could not accept what you sent: the reason is on the line, send it again |
| Under review | We have it and a person on our team is checking it |
| Done | Nothing more to do |

